WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV — rce-jepa (30s) Narrator Jyothi

1
00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:03.551
Generating tokens in raw source code burns 84 joules

2
00:00:03.551 --> 00:00:07.474
locally with no guarantee the program even handles edge cases.

3
00:00:07.594 --> 00:00:17.383
RCE-JEPA predicts over compact lossless Forms—median 9.34x smaller—where a 49-millijoule checker rejects every invalid mutant.

4
00:00:17.503 --> 00:00:22.866
An 8.4-million-parameter FormJEPA lifts zero-LLM closure to 91.4 percent,

5
00:00:22.866 --> 00:00:27.274
while bounded checker feedback closes all 40 residual tasks.

6
00:00:27.394 --> 00:00:31.185
When rung-f hit 2.5 percent against a 2.0 percent threshold,

7
00:00:31.185 --> 00:00:34.028
the harness honestly kept it in observe mode.
